 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Lots of them, but one that helps a lot is taking a short break every 50 minutes. Get up, step away from your desk or where you sit, and do something simple and mindless for few minutes. It can be, especially if you let it. But you can turn off notifications, keep your phone across the room, or use quiet mode. You can use app to block sound during certain hours, or just leave the room for a few minutes each time. A short walk around the block is also a great break. It' a great option, many cities now have quiet ones.",
